+    ///   sign-extended 64-bit values the signed 128-bit product is exact, and
+    ///   its low 128 bits are what the 128-bit multiply defines.
+    /// * `RightHighZero`: `%rax:%rdx` = lhs, `%rcx` = rhs.lo.
